{"id": 14412, "title": "Where are you going?", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "where-are-you-going", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/14412_where-are-you-going.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["A：早！吃早饭了吗？", "B：早！吃了。你去上班啊？", "A：今天星期六，不上班。", "B：对，今天星期六！现在那么早，你要去哪儿？", "A：我要去图书馆，很久没看书了。", "B：那你今天又不能看了。", "A：为什么？", "B：图书馆今天和明天有活动，学生才能去。", "A：是吗？我不知道！那我去公园跑步吧。谢谢你。", "B：不用谢。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["A：早！吃早飯了嗎？", "B：早！吃了。你去上班啊？", "A：今天星期六，不上班。", "B：對，今天星期六！現在那麼早，你要去哪兒？", "A：我要去圖書館，很久沒看書了。", "B：那你今天又不能看了。", "A：為什麼？", "B：圖書館今天和明天有活動，學生才能去。", "A：是嗎？我不知道！那我去公園跑步吧。謝謝你。", "B：不用謝。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["A： zǎo！ chī zǎo fàn le ma？", "B： zǎo！ chī le。 nǐ qù shàng bān á？", "A： jīn tiān xīng qī liù， bù shàng bān。", "B： duì， jīn tiān xīng qī liù！ xiàn zài nà me zǎo， nǐ yào qù nǎ r？", "A： wǒ yào qù tú shū guǎn， hěn jiǔ méi kàn shū le。", "B： nà nǐ jīn tiān yòu bù néng kàn le。", "A： wèi shén me？", "B： tú shū guǎn jīn tiān hé míng tiān yǒu huó dòng， xué shēng cái néng qù。", "A： shì ma？ wǒ bù zhī dào！ nà wǒ qù gōng yuán pǎo bù ba。 xiè xie nǐ。", "B： bù yòng xiè。"], "english_paragraphs": ["A: Morning! Have you had breakfast?", "B: Morning! have eaten. Are you going to work?", "A: Today is Saturday, so I don’t work.", "B: Yes, today is Saturday! It's so early, where are you going?", "A: I'm going to the library. I haven't read a book in a long time.", "B: Then you can’t watch it today.", "A: Why?", "B: There are activities in the library today and tomorrow, so students can go there.", "A: Really? I have no idea! Then I'll go for a run in the park. Thank you.", "B: You're welcome."], "english_full": "A: Morning! Have you had breakfast?\n\nB: Morning! have eaten. Are you going to work?\n\nA: Today is Saturday, so I don’t work.\n\nB: Yes, today is Saturday! It's so early, where are you going?\n\nA: I'm going to the library. I haven't read a book in a long time.\n\nB: Then you can’t watch it today.\n\nA: Why?\n\nB: There are activities in the library today and tomorrow, so 